() Tj T*
(This Supply Agreement \(the "Agreement"\) is made as of 2025-08-14 \(the "Effective Date"\) by) Tj T*
(and between Harbor & Finch Supply Co., a Texas company \("Supplier"\), and Vantage Point) Tj T*
