() Tj T*
(1. SCOPE. Supplier shall deliver the products listed in Schedule A within ten \(10\)) Tj T*
(business days of each purchase order, packaged to prevent damage in transit.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. TERM. This Agreement begins on the Effective Date and ends on Aug 14, 2027, unless) Tj T*
(terminated earlier under Section 6.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. PAYMENT. Buyer shall pay for each delivery at the unit prices in Schedule A within) Tj T*
(forty-five \(45\) days of the invoice date.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. CONFIDENTIALITY. Each party shall keep the other party's confidential information) Tj T*
(secret, use it only to perform this Agreement, and return or destroy it when this) Tj T*
(Agreement ends.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. WARRANTIES. Each party warrants that it has the authority to enter into this Agreement) Tj T*
(and that performing it will not breach any other agreement it is bound by.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6. TERMINATION. Either party may terminate this Agreement for convenience on 90 days') Tj T*
(written notice, or immediately if the other party materially breaches this Agreement and) Tj T*
(does not cure the breach within 30 days of written notice.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(7. LIMITATION OF LIABILITY. Neither party is liable for indirect or consequential damages.) Tj T*
(Each party's total liability is capped at the fees paid in the twelve months before the) Tj T*
(claim.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
